      },
      "m_displayImage1": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_JusticarF_B_NPC.dds",
      "m_displayImage2": "",
      "m_clientTags": [],
      "m_genericEvents": [],
      "m_autoQualify": false,
      "m_autoComplete": false,
      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ah, Wizard. I've heard of you. The stranger who fights the Shadow with Shadow Magic. Are these rumors true?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_JusticarF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PraetorDrusilla_EM2_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413249,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Excellent! The Justicaria are the light that pierces the darkness, but we've had little experience against Shadow-kind. We could use practice.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_JusticarF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PraetorDrusilla_EM2_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413249,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And you must be Sparck. I served under your mother, herself Praetor of the Justicaria. How odd to see you here, fully grown... making demands.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_JusticarF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PraetorDrusilla_EM2_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413249,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Heh. How about this: if your friend goes to the Training Grounds and spars against my troops, I'll tell you everything. What do you say, Wizard?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_JusticarF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PraetorDrusilla_EM2_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413249,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Looks like this little exercise was worthwhile. My troops clearly need more training. Come on back, Wizard. I'll complete my side of the bargain.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_JusticarF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PraetorDrusilla_EM2_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413249,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Because he WAS a traitor to the cause Raven gave our ancestors eons ago: prepare for the inevitable war with the Shadow.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_JusticarF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PraetorDrusilla_EM2_06.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413249,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "To that end, we devote all our resources to weapons development. But some - like Keras - would rather we allocate those resources elsewhere.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_JusticarF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PraetorDrusilla_EM2_07.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413249,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And one day, your father acted on his beliefs, built a bomb to short out our weapons. A remarkably violent path to pacifism.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_JusticarF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PraetorDrusilla_EM2_08.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413249,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "That boy's father cost us much, including our greatest Praetor. A traitor's son may not be himself a traitor, but there's a lot of Keras in him.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_JusticarF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PraetorDrusilla_EM2_09.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413249,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
